                     "lymfknuta"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Nodus lymphoideus"@la ;
    solid-memo:backNote "Lymphatic system: a small oval or bean-shaped body along the lymph vessels; also called a lymph gland."@en ,
                        "Lymfsystemet: en liten oval eller bönformad knuta längs lymfkärlen; kallas också lymfkörtel."@sv .
